# The pr-shepherd overlay is shared config, not local state: the skill BODY is
# global (symlinked from the claude-skills spine) and reads these three files to
# learn this repo's CI gates. Untracked, they would be invisible to everyone else
# and absent from a fresh clone.
!.claude/skills
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/pr-shepherd
.claude/skills/pr-shepherd/*
